@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="ae-card mx-auto" style="max-width: 40rem;">
    <h1 class="h4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">
        Agri-Energy Connect stores the details needed to run the service: account email
        addresses, farmer names, contact numbers and addresses, and the produce listings
        farmers submit. Farmer names, farm addresses and listings are visible on the public
        marketplace. Contact numbers and email addresses are only visible to employees.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">
        The application does not use analytics or advertising trackers and does not share
        data with third parties. It loads fonts and front-end libraries from public CDNs,
        which may log standard request information such as your IP address.
    </p>
</div>
